    "text": {
     "en": "The Preamble begins with 'We, the people of India' and promises justice, liberty, equality and fraternity. India is a sovereign, socialist, secular, democratic republic.\nFundamental duties are things every citizen should do, such as respecting the Constitution, protecting the environment and public property, and promoting harmony.\nRights and duties go together."
    }
